      <Placemark>
        <name>Isla Margarita</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26: island; display keeps the page's hard-coded flight-polyline endpoint (legacy-polyline, on the island); not road-connected, drive point is the Conferry terminal at Puerto La Cruz (mainland car ferry to Margarita); the closing leg from Taganga arrives here by flight per override.json; legacy Google marker kept, 1502 m from wikipedia:en:Margarita_Island</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-63.929052,10.998852,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Parque Nacional Canaima</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26: national park, no address in query: display at Canaima village on Canaima Lagoon, the park's main visitor hub, which has no road access; drive point is Tomas de Heres Airport, Ciudad Bolivar, the usual air departure for Canaima (Troncal 10 through the park's Gran Sabana sector is the road-accessible part)</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-62.852937,6.235794,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
